      "author": "Imogen Vance",
      "text": "3320 had the February event too \u2014 the 2026-04 letter does not cover a second event. 3355 is covered and clean.",
      "ts": "2026-04-13T10:20:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Freya Tidemand",
      "text": "storefront-web is on the metered basis: 17.3 GB at the 04-09 metering, not the 8.4 GB onboarding figure. The edge-widget train uses the 5 GB class and its own set.",
      "ts": "2026-04-13T10:31:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Bisi Oyelaran",
      "text": "An expedited pull would be mine to approve; nobody has asked.",
      "ts": "2026-04-13T10:44:00"
    }
  ],
  "thread_id": "CHAT-1008",
  "title": "HOST-0008 storefront scrub fallout"
}

